# Her Memories: Azure Footfalls (crystalWar 70), the rival at Roderich: a level 99 Warrior in North Gustaberg [S] with
# the WotG mission Her Memories current (a GM; other logs as group 1's flows), Azure accepted at Prog 3 (a GM) and What
# Price Loyalty (crystalWar 50, group 5) accepted at Prog 0 with the Sack of Victuals (GMs). Roderich answers Azure's
# 15 and What Price Loyalty's 10, both Progress: the tie goes to the first container, Azure: 15, finished: Prog 4.
# Prog 3 again (a GM): the tie rotates: 10, finished: What Price Loyalty Prog 1, the sack taken. Prog 3 again and the
# lookup's cycle put at 15 (GMs): 15 (Progress) over What Price Loyalty's 11 (an Event; a Progress 11 would tie and
# rotate to it), finished: Prog 4. Then 11 alone.
lists NorthGustabergS/Roderich/onTrigger NorthGustabergS/onEventFinish/10 NorthGustabergS/onEventFinish/15
char zone=NorthGustabergS pos=-398.539,39.991,-90.445 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Wotg HerMemories current
quest CrystalWar.HerMemoriesAzureFootfalls accepted
charvar Quest[7][70]Prog 3
quest CrystalWar.WhatPriceLoyalty accepted
keyitem SackOfVictuals
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
login
trigger Roderich                        # 15 and 10 tie (Progress): 15, the first container
finish                                  # Prog 4
charvar Quest[7][70]Prog 3              # a GM
trigger Roderich                        # the tie rotates: 10
finish                                  # What Price Loyalty Prog 1; the sack taken
charvar Quest[7][70]Prog 3              # a GM
localvar [Action][Roderich][onTrigger] 15 # a GM: the cycle at 15
trigger Roderich                        # 15 (Progress) over 11 (an Event)
finish                                  # Prog 4
trigger Roderich                        # Prog 4: 11 alone
finish
